'''Temple Supplies''' is the rewards shop for the [[Guardians of the Rift]] minigame, accessed by talking to [[Apprentice Felix]] at the minigame's entrance. At the rewards shop, players can use the [[abyssal pearls]] earned in the minigame to purchase helpful items for training [[Runecraft]].

[[Talisman]]s whose altars require quests to access do not appear in the shop if the respective quest has not been completed.

